# Haskell style & build

## Formatting (Fourmolu — strict)
- 2-space indent, 80 cols, leading commas & import/export style
- Leading function arrows; `single-constraint-parens: never`; `unicode: never`
- `scripts/format.sh` or `fourmolu -i ./src ./examples ./test ./jshark-lucid`

## Build
- `cabal build` | `cabal test` | `cabal run examples` (http://localhost:3000)
- Library: `-Wall -Wextra -Werror`; match existing extensions and module conventions
